sequenceDiagram
  participant Queue
  participant Lane as Fast or bulk lane
  participant Handler
  participant DB as Database and external services
  Lane->>Queue: Claim jobs up to lane capacity
  Queue-->>Lane: Claimed jobs
  Lane->>Handler: Dispatch typed task and payload
  Handler->>DB: Execute task effects
  DB-->>Handler: Result
  alt Completed
    Handler-->>Queue: Complete claim
  else Deferred
    Handler-->>Queue: Defer for later processing
  else Failed
    Handler-->>Lane: Return error
    Lane->>Queue: Let claim lease expire for retry
  end
  Lane->>Queue: Heartbeat active claims
